  "scientific_decision_basis": [
    "The new WHS median mean113.97 versus115 and BMI Spearman mean.3362 versus.33 are approximately compatible with the rounded source values and modeled context; no acceptance threshold or equivalence claim is made.",
    "WHS q25 andq75 means78.75 and165.56 versus81 and169 are below in all3 draws, and high-TG proportion.3192 is below.3343. A uniform female shift could reduce these differences while worsening Oh female mean97.86 versus97.2 and high-BMI stratum135.43 versus127.3.",
    "WHS age Spearman.2043-.2222 exceeds.18 in all3 draws, accompanied by high-TG age56.13-56.18 versus55.6. Simply weakening the age response would also reduce Oh age50-59 mean120.02-122.15, already below127.8; Oh age30-39 mean80.42-81.19 is close to80.7. Different age shapes are possible but not identified by these marginal summaries.",
    "Oh male BMI>30 mean180.76-202.50 is below220.5 and BMI<20 mean94.92-98.64 exceeds91.8. Female BMI>30 mean132.80-139.50 exceeds127.3; pooled BMI OLS5.894-6.247 is below6.813 while WHS BMI rank association is already close. These dependent summaries do not uniquely determine a sex-specific nonlinear conditional relation under fixed independent source covariates.",
    "The age and BMI input diagnostics are constant across seeds and can deviate from source moments because of the frozen recipe. Residual seed variation cannot repair those assumptions.",
    "Retain the current scientific model instead of fitting further parameters to uncertain, overlapping and partly conflicting source diagnostics. The budget permits retention and supplies no requirement to improve a score or achieve a desired direction."
  ],
  "remaining_limitations": [
    "All34 diagnostics remain approximate; no aggregate success score or calibrated pass threshold.",
    "Three-seed ranges/SD describe individual residual sampling with fixed covariates and parameters, not source uncertainty or confidence intervals.",
    "Source joint age-BMI structure, omitted covariates, treatment/selection, family dependence and plasma/serum transport remain unrepresented.",
    "Oh arithmetic/geometric scale ambiguity and WHS quantile convention/rounding remain unresolved.",
    "Source agreement is development evidence; target-population validity and unreported analyses are unassessed.",
    "Incidental qualitative historical target-summary wording from skill-directed README access was disclosed initially and is not used in the retention rationale."
  ],
